Project Development 











Project: ShopFlow — High-Scale E-Commerce & Order Management Platform
Stack

Backend: Java 21, Spring Boot 3, Spring Security, JPA/Hibernate
Database: PostgreSQL
Cache: Redis
Messaging: Kafka
Search: Elasticsearch/OpenSearch
Frontend: React + TypeScript
Testing: JUnit 5, Mockito, Testcontainers
API: REST + WebSocket where useful
Deployment: Docker + AWS
Architecture: Modular monolith first → selected services/event-driven components
DevOps: Docker, GitHub Actions, AWS
The objective isn't just to make an e-commerce website.

You are going to build a production-style distributed order platform that forces you to understand:

DSA + Java + Spring Boot + SQL + transactions + concurrency + caching + messaging + system design + AWS

That's much closer to the skill combination you want.

